OL,3,GNEWSAIrish army received warning day
OL,4,Abefore Omagh bomb, inquiry told
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe told the hearing that a warning call
OL,7,Fwas received on 14 August 1998 at
OL,8,FFinner Camp near Ballyshannon, County
OL,9,FDonegal.
OL,11,F"The caller wasn't drunk, sounded
OL,12,Fsensible and said, get onto the guards,
OL,13,Ftell them to check the back routes or
OL,14,Fback roads and then repeats three
OL,15,Ftimes: Omagh, Omagh, Omagh."
